{% doc %}
  One plain-text line on product pages: "New clients: sign up for 10% off your
  first jewelry purchase." Shoppers and AI shopping assistants comparing prices
  can see the welcome offer without signing up first. The code itself stays
  behind the signup (welcome popup / footer form).

  Jewelry only (merchant, 2026-10-28): shown when the product is in one of the
  jewelry collections the LMNYWELCOME discount covers (Shopify Admin ->
  Discounts) and is not a watch or a loose stone. Loose lab-grown and natural
  diamond pages do not render this snippet, and the two loose-diamond
  collections are left out of the list. Update ELIGIBLE below if the discount's collections change.
  Hidden for customers who already signed up (tag welcome10).

  @param {product} product - The product being shown

  @example
  {% render 'welcome-offer-line', product: product %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign eligible_handles = 'earrings,rings,necklaces,bracelets,pendants-1,wedding-bands,engagement-rings,mens-wedding-bands,vintage-jewelry,estate-jewelry,cartier,chopard,hermes,tiffany,van-cleef-arpels,mens-rings,bvlgari,verdura,seaman-schepps,lab-grown-diamond-jewelry,lab-grown-bracelets,lab-grown-necklaces,lab-grown-pendants,lab-grown-earrings,lab-grown-rings,lab-grown-engagement-rings' | split: ','
  assign offer_ok = false
  for c in product.collections
    if eligible_handles contains c.handle
      assign offer_ok = true
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}
{%- capture offer_is_watch -%}{% render 'product-is-watch', product: product %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if offer_is_watch contains 'true' -%}{%- assign offer_ok = false -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if customer.tags contains 'welcome10' -%}{%- assign offer_ok = false -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- if offer_ok -%}
  <p class="lm-offer-line">
    New clients: <a href="#FooterSignup" data-welcome-open>sign up for 10% off</a> your first jewelry purchase.
  </p>
  <style>
    .lm-offer-line {
      margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
      font-family: var(--font-body, 'Montserrat', sans-serif);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-dark, #2C1810);
    }
    .lm-offer-line a {
      color: inherit;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
    }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
